  "nameOrigin": "After Alfred Nobel; the name was proposed for a 1957 claim from the Nobel Institute in Stockholm and was kept.",
  "source": "iupac_discovery",
  "doi": "10.1351/pac199365081757",
  "note": "PubChem gives 1957, the year of the Stockholm claim, which could not be reproduced. Berkeley reported work in 1958 and Jefferson Lab says Berkeley was eventually credited, but the 1993 IUPAC/IUPAP report gives the credit to two 1966 Dubna papers.",
